{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415712","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415712","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041571201:1":{"text":"呀！奥萝菈，你怎么一副没睡醒的样子？","source_cn":"呀！奥萝菈，你怎么一副没睡醒的样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C2473FBC4A5792","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041571202:1":{"text":"唔……我做了一个很……很混乱的梦。","source_cn":"唔……我做了一个很……很混乱的梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE20EDA2B3D743F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041571203:1":{"text":"我梦到了一片沙漠，沙漠的天空中飞翔着一只巨大的鲸鱼……","source_cn":"我梦到了一片沙漠，沙漠的天空中飞翔着一只巨大的鲸鱼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79124BE0015E6527","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041571204:1":{"text":"啊……那你一定会觉得它很孤单！","source_cn":"啊……那你一定会觉得它很孤单！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D4DED8E77050410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041571205:1":{"text":"嗯，没错……","source_cn":"嗯，没错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9BBABAD0284468D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041571206:1":{"text":"“要是，它能见到同伴，就好了”……我这样想了。","source_cn":"“要是，它能见到同伴，就好了”……我这样想了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48412B6A56E7C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041571207:1":{"text":"然后，沙漠就下起了暴雨……水面上升，最后变成一片汪洋。","source_cn":"然后，沙漠就下起了暴雨……水面上升，最后变成一片汪洋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF26FF825A72BDF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041571208:1":{"text":"简直就像……经历了一场海啸……","source_cn":"简直就像……经历了一场海啸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B69D90FDB607404","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041571209:1":{"text":"塔西，我好像在梦里的沙漠见过你……你没有被海水吞没吧？","source_cn":"塔西，我好像在梦里的沙漠见过你……你没有被海水吞没吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x150A49CFB6CDF3C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041571210:1":{"text":"哦……我、我一点事也没有！","source_cn":"哦……我、我一点事也没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA23F65C0D07B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041571211:1":{"text":"我可是梦境妖精，怎么会在梦里受伤呢……？！","source_cn":"我可是梦境妖精，怎么会在梦里受伤呢……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37718CCAEDF112F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","va